{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 20,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Peril of Not Progressing"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, leaving the discussion of the elementary "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "principles"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Christ, let us go on to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "maturity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perfection, not laying again the foundation of repentance from dead works and of faith toward God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the doctrine of baptisms, of laying on of hands, of resurrection of the dead, and of eternal judgment. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M let us do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "we will do if God permits."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " impossible for those who were once enlightened, and have tasted the heavenly gift, and have become partakers of the Holy Spirit, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and have tasted the good word of God and the powers of the age to come, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or and have fallen away"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if they fall away, to renew them again to repentance, since they crucify again for themselves the Son of God, and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to an open shame."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the earth which drinks in the rain that often comes upon it, and bears herbs useful for those by whom it is cultivated, receives blessing from God; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but if it bears thorns and briers, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " rejected and near to being cursed, whose end "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to be burned."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Better Estimate"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But, beloved, we are confident of better things concerning you, yes, things that accompany salvation, though we speak in this manner. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not unjust to forget your work and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits labor of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "labor of love which you have shown toward His name, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you have ministered to the saints, and do minister. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we desire that each one of you show the same diligence to the full assurance of hope until the end, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that you do not become "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "lazy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sluggish, but imitate those who through faith and patience inherit the promises."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "God’s Infallible Purpose in Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For when God made a promise to Abraham, because He could swear by no one greater, He swore by Himself, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Surely blessing I will bless you, and multiplying I will multiply you.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And so, after he had patiently endured, he obtained the promise. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For men indeed swear by the greater, and an oath for confirmation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for them an end of all dispute. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus God, determining to show more abundantly to the heirs of promise the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "unchangeableness of His purpose"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "immutability of His counsel, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "guaranteed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "confirmed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by an oath, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that by two "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "unchangeable"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "immutable things, in which it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " impossible for God to lie, we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M omits might"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "might have strong consolation, who have fled for refuge to lay hold of the hope set before "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "us."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "hope"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " we have as an anchor of the soul, both sure and steadfast, and which enters the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Presence"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " behind the veil, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "where the forerunner has entered for us, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "even"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jesus, having become High Priest forever according to the order of Melchizedek."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}